.nh
.TH "PB-PREVIEW-STATUS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-preview-status - Show temporary preview status


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb preview status <preview> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one preview's access, target, state and deadline. A preview that exists is not
necessarily reachable: if nothing answers on the target yet, visitors see "App not responding"
until your app starts.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print the canonical preview resource as JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb preview status preview_abc123
  pb preview status preview_abc123 --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-preview(1)\fP
